{
  "id": "JHN.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 18",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ging'ooyda Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iyahiit Yesu rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu gawa giigheawda moangoachiyda Gidironi sea ginealangaaschi, abeeda hoowa gwanda madamnyeanji mwanang', hean gawa Yesu jeeda sea ginealangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda Yudayda jea ghwalabwadaw ninyiin, abeeda ghwanal hoowa; aba gideaba eawoojisu iissa gabadiini hoowa Yesu sea ginealangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Yuda gharmucheanda shirikara ea furiischoodiga leabu heeda ashoohoodiga hees ea heeda Farisaayajeega, ak goodeana nea gwandeawa gheaboonyanga ea dabita ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean jeeng'u Yesu ng'asheanda jea ghwahidu, ng'ata ghoahiimda geaw ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Googaseadayi ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Saawa nea gwayeesha, “Yesuheeda Nasareti.” Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Ada aniini.” Nea abeeda Yudayda jea ghwalabwadaw ghamiinaada aba hoowa sea saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwayeesha saawa, “Aniini gil,” gabiikta bwadaw ak goobeedeaysa ng'eanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta ghoanyaash, “Googaseadayi ng'eaha?” Gwayeesha saawa, “Yesuheeda Nasareti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Neada ea mearukuneegwa gideaba aniini gil; asi iyoogassean aniini abeeda ghoanung'waadi fiisu gaweay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarukuta ng'asheesu ak abeeda gwasa ng'asheega ghayi rugu bea gideaba, “Fuga ghayi igoonyean mii dahuta eara akaleala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwandeawa Simon Betaro ng'uta, gooseelu ak ghwalach iita geatinda dugwa bea giing'oonyaneeda ashoohoocheanda haw. Nea giing'oonyaneedida geeguura gheawungaaschi Malko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu Betaro, “Adealda ng'utaang'u jeeda labaldaanyi; heapi, gajea mwaaleaydani gikoombeeyda ghayi goonan Bwaabwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu aba madeeda Anasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'waay Yesu gharmucheandida bea Shirikaraan sea shirikarajeanda haw sea furiischoodiga Yahudi ak geerada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geesheeda eayaat heeda Anasi; abeeda gweargweeda agweaji Gayafa gil nea abeeda Gayafa ea ashoohoocheanda haw gil gweaydida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Gayafeeni ea siida ghayi rukusa fugiga bea Yahudi gideaba ghang'wana ghami siyagi aba badahuuka buuneedean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Betaro ghwashaang' Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwaat Simon Betaro geeshta Yesu sea giinealan nuut. Nea abeeda giinealaneeni ghwanal muuchi ashoohoocheanda Haw, hean gawa jeeda doodooda gheeda ashoohoocheanda Haw nea goodeayi Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Betaro niny abeeda ghamiinaada aba jarooda nea neekeewa gidaghuuta. Iidu gwardu jarooda giinealaneedida nal ashoohoocheanda Hawiin ak goobalool huda fur gidaghuuta, ak ghwaat Betaro gah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoanyaash Hudida ghwanyawa fur gidaghuudiin Betaro nea gwayeesha, “Muwoosi siyagi aba jeeda giinealangeaba siisi?” Gwayeesha, “Meawoosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida ea nighwar beasta ghuurga soomjooga sea furiischoodiga aba gideaba ghwaraanya gooroogeeda, hean ghamiinaada nea gwaju beasta; aba damandida eara Betaro ghamiinaada aba hoowa nea gwajoohuudayi beasta saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashoohoocheanda Haw goonyeari Yesu ng'asheega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanyaash ashoohoocheanda Haw Yesu iita ginealangaaschi ea iita giinealshoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Aniini eawoojisu iissa geabalooli ng'eanyiida aba eeshpwara; nea iissa geanealshi aba jeeda ghoorajeega siinealshacheewa ea jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA galeagasean, heeda roondooscheesa fuga Yahudi sean; nea moang'wa darukuta ng'asheanda wassean aba makcheameeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasaan anda giinyaashchaan aniini? Anyaasha fugiga ghayi iiy ng'asheega earukusiin; saawa ghwanal ng'asheega ghayi earukusi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu ghwalas madeang'da Yesu furiischoocheanji ghwanyawa miinaada aba hoowa nea gwayeesha, “Nih gidirukusiindi ashoohoocheanda hawi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Iineargu ng'asheanda muy abeeda gimuuwu munyindaanyi ea ng'asheanda was, ama ghwanyawa eargu ng'asheanda nea ghwadoabiiw, abeeda gilaksean naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' Anasi eerada ak geayaat heeda Ashoohoocheanda Haw was Gayafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Betaro gabiikta ghwashaang' Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida Simon Betaro gudughamiinaada nea gwaju beasta. Hean geanyaash nea geeyeesha, “Heapi eara ang'iing'i muwoosi siyagi bea jeeda ginealangaaschi?” Ghwashaang' niny nea gwayeesha, “Meawoosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda siisi was soomjeanda aba gheeda ashoohoocheanda haw, nea siisi gaba gheawagi sea siidida lach Betaro iitean, ghoanyaash, “Heapi aniini mii dadeakseeyi jeeda madamnyeanda mwanang' sea niny?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta ghwashaang' Betaro gicha ea mii ghoah gil googuul nghaghooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu aba madeeda Bilato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geegeanda Yesu aba gheeh Gayafa ak geayaat gheeda abiita sugoocheanda nea gudea beashata gil ak ea maweayi saawa jeedeaba gheedida aba gideaba ea mwang'udana geat ririnnyeanda ak abeeda ghwaak hamita Basaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Bilato ghwanyasa saawa jarooda ak gwayeesha, “Goondeawi girgweageemba naaha aba badaydeaba siisi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Saawa ak gwayeesha, “Siisi inyeeda ghwanyawa ea masina ng'asheega munyas ea majeeyeana headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Bilato saawa, “Asi ada abeeda ghoayaachi agooga ak goorgweaksi aba deaweedeedeang'wa.” Gwayeesha fuga Yahudi niny, “Mamiiseasa aseasa gideaba gajeenuusa siida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gwasa ng'asheanda ghayi rugu Yesu nea ghoahiimu miyeeda jea ghami giduurji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta Bilato jeeda gheeda sugoocheanduumeeda ak gaguursa Yesu ak ghoanyaash, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi sugoocheanda Yahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ng'asheesu girgu ang'iing'i ghana rukuneey buuneeda iiteanyu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Bilato nea gwayeesha, “Neada aniini geawooschi siida Yahudi? Ang'iing'i gweaneey heedeanyu fuga eemeedeang'wa sea ashoohoodiga hees. Neada ea nisini naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Sugoocheanduumeedeanyu maba badaydeaba ng'eanyiini; ama inyeeda sugoocheanduumeedeanyu gaba badaydeaba ng'eanyiini, ghwanyawa gaygang'uchi soomjoogeasu aba meatkweedeanyu ea meeyiinan geatinga fuga Yahudi; amaduuku ghamneawa sugoocheanduumeedeanyu ea maba ng'eanyiini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Bilato niny, “Asi ghamneawa ang'iing'i guwoosi sugoocheanda?” Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Girgu ang'iing'i gideaba aniini geawooschi sugoocheanda. Aniini geejiilan aba badaydeaba nih, nea aba badaydeaba nih ghaawunyi jeeda ng'eanyiida, gideaba gaydamuuwu huumeanda. Siida wassean mida jeeda huumeanda iissa gooleeysiit ghuuteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Bilato niny, “Huumeanda naaha gil?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu geergweaksiina miyeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu gabiikta gicha heeda fuga Yahudi mida jarooda ak gwayeesha, “Aniini mwaadaahi giidiinyeandeaba siisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goondeawi agooga seareeda ghaheang'wa iissa googasayi deatineegwa siyagi mida ghealooniga damanda ghweelmeeda Basaaka; asi googasayi deatineegwa sugoocheanda Yahudi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta goojuur nea gwayeesha, “Mii siisi, geegasayi Baraba!” Nea Baraba abeeda gooreedi buuneeda haleanjeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
